sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Simulation loop (run.js)
  participant W as Cached trace (48 slots per day)
  participant C as Governor core
  participant G as Real gate + audit log

  S->>C: reset() at midnight - new daily budget
  loop every 30-minute slot
    S->>W: peer signal for this slot
    S->>G: evaluate(task energy x peer signal)
    G->>C: decide(estimate)
    G-->>S: verdict
    S->>S: run now, run degraded, defer to cleanest slot, or drop
    S->>W: national actual for the slot it ran in
    S->>C: commit(actual grams)
  end
  S->>G: audit.verify() at the end of the arm
  G-->>S: chain valid
